{
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 22,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.086,
            0.926,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": "？ **Given the dimensions of a grid, can you tell the parity of the number of small squares without calculating the product?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.371,
            0.159,
            0.702,
            0.351
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_22_image_1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.381,
            0.169,
            0.397
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.409,
            0.927,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": "The parity of the number of small squares in a grid (with m rows and n columns) is:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.457,
            0.778,
            0.476
          ],
          "content": "(i) Even, if at least one of the numbers (either m or n) is even."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.477,
            0.606,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": "(ii) Odd, if both numbers (m and n) are odd."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.496,
            0.623,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": "(iii) Even, if both numbers (m and n) are even."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.554,
            0.252,
            0.573
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No- 132"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.583,
            0.81,
            0.603
          ],
          "content": "**Find the parity of the number of small squares in these grids:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.613,
            0.272,
            0.632
          ],
          "content": "(a) $2 7 \\times 1 3$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.634,
            0.273,
            0.652
          ],
          "content": "(b) $4 2 \\times 7 8$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.655,
            0.292,
            0.674
          ],
          "content": "(c) 135 × 654"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.687,
            0.169,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.707,
            0.245,
            0.725
          ],
          "content": "(a) Odd"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.728,
            0.252,
            0.746
          ],
          "content": "(b) Even"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.749,
            0.251,
            0.767
          ],
          "content": "(c) Even"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.779,
            0.74,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": "？ **Come up with an expression that always has odd parity.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.801,
            0.17,
            0.817
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.821,
            0.736,
            0.84
          ],
          "content": "Some such expressions are 2m + 1, 8a + 3; 4n + 3, 6n + 5 etc."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.851,
            0.925,
            0.891
          ],
          "content": "**Come up with other expressions, like 3n + 4, which could have either odd or even parity.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.894,
            0.169,
            0.911
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.514,
            0.928,
            0.528,
            0.941
          ],
          "content": "4"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
